```bash
pnpm vitest run tests/integration/cloudflare-sandbox-agent-lanes.test.ts  # 28 pass (25 + 3 selector)
pnpm typecheck   # clean
pnpm check       # oxfmt + oxlint + type-aware, clean
```

### Burn-In Gate (unchanged)

D3 stays at **zero**. The probe redeploys, then ONE dream-shape run is watched
node-by-node. Captured on deployed code → fire the operator Discord ping with the
wzrrd HITL URL, reset D3, start the 10-run burn-in. Still planner-blocked at ~583s
→ pi is pathologically slow or the sync exec hit a platform wall; pursue the
reserved class fix (async planner / pre-baked image) with its own chaos test,
pdf-brain quote, and receipt. The probe's job is to tell us **which**.
